{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">CRYING BOOTH is a compilation of five single player scenarios created by CRYING BOOTH. Game one through four are first person experiences with stealth, survival, and puzzle elements, while Game five is a side-scroller platformer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351740/extras/SACRIFICE_SMALLER_LOGO.png?t=1748421299\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Get sacrifices to revive a hanging man. Follow his direction or do as you please.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Use cover and be aware of sight lines as you take everyone out. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Look</i></strong><i> out for ammo to help with long distance kills!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351740/extras/RITUAL_SMALLER_LOGO.png?t=1748421299\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>You\u00a0are\u00a0seeking\u00a0revenge\u00a0on\u00a0someone\u00a0who\u00a0has\u00a0wronged\u00a0you.\u00a0Play\u00a0with\u00a0fire\u00a0and\u00a0complete\u00a0the\u00a0ritual.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Eliminate anyone on your way and find a way to take him out.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Manage the small amount of ammo you have left.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351740/extras/GATHER_SMALLER_LOGO.png?t=1748421299\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>It's Halloween night and your friends are coming over to trick or treat. Collect\u00a0as\u00a0much\u00a0candy as\u00a0you\u00a0can!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Watch\u00a0out\u00a0for\u00a0<strong>HIM</strong>.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351740/extras/SURVIVE_SMALLER_LOGO.png?t=1748421299\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>You wandered into a carnival after hours, and ended up trapped in a tent.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Can you outlast them all?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351740/extras/ALONE_SMALLER_LOGO.png?t=1748421299\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Walking\u00a0home\u00a0alone,\u00a0but\u00a0there\u00a0are\u00a0so\u00a0many\u00a0distractions.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Avoid\u00a0<strong>everyone</strong>\u00a0and\u00a0find\u00a0a\u00a0way\u00a0home.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Gamepads are supported, but do not fully support all menus.</i></strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2351740?t=1748421299","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351740/d5248a347ab6c313a7359000fa2f222ea1280a1c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748421299","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351740/de52f92cf64149d1809de3199bfd0bb1d23ae37f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748421299","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2351740/de52f92cf64149d1809de3199bfd0bb1d23ae37f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748421299","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Pixelated blood and gore.\r\nConstant drug use.\r\nDismembered body parts."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_parag